WIRE.md §5.1: decoding reads any number of the field's unit whose value is a whole number of milliseconds, so `"cast_time": 1.5` under `@json(unit: s)` decodes to 1s500ms, which has no wire form in seconds: E8102 at the value, reported by verification (`FieldForms`) before writing; `2` seconds is fine.
-- type --
fpdemo.Skill
-- skills/SI_FIREBALL.json --
{"dwID": "SI_FIREBALL", "legacy": {"reqMp": 0, "reqFp": 0}, "flags": 0, "bTwoHanded": 0, "side": "both", "cast_time": 1.5, "weights": {}}
-- skills/SI_ICE.json --
{"dwID": "SI_ICE", "legacy": {"reqMp": 0, "reqFp": 0}, "flags": 0, "bTwoHanded": 0, "side": "both", "cast_time": 2, "weights": {}}
-- findings.txt --
error[E8102]  skills/SI_FIREBALL.json:1:119
  1s500ms has no wire form for castTime: not a whole number of s

